$$M = \bigl\{[x_i] \in R : \forall\, j \geq i,\; f_{ij}(x_i) \in \mathfrak{m}_j\bigr\}.$$

By Step 1, $[x_i] \in M$ if and only if $[x_i]$ is **not** a unit in $R$. So $M$ is exactly the set of non-units of $R$.

